      ],
      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/nocona-tx",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "By 1910 Nocona was home to a dozen cotton‑purchasing companies, reflecting the town’s role in the regional cotton trade.",
